omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XUxpp-zz_9UQ7kNvwHqyckd&_nc_oc=Adq6IoXBvhwdf_zmWxKqyHHecrA6OItLtapSGSGcNfuQHebHlle8HS8vCIeqw4viWEU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af37xTlkx1DUnnK11shZF3eTAsIp-FjI3II5Wh1r8SyJ1A&oe=69D4E8F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0VTIioXMvGoQ7kNvwH-fLYU&_nc_oc=AdogmlBgldXro1mSK8suSCI5cY0jd3Xnl4z9Tkz3R8cR4la2SA7m4EIdG656LvTcoHc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1wGScrM7LPLZH3w-fXkCgceKQAH_XBYdz-mPptGBvkRg&oe=69D4EA56"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qIF2WGowIroQ7kNvwEShHSH&_nc_oc=Adpjjt1JvgUdP0iPNNSBau2XQZ8Ksv4YeM_JemCsk4hdfD5-ZVgOLU33EWA9aqNRau0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3exmZ1-QEXPJHWbL3u7BjaD9d8w_mKlFlE-7LSzfIpeg&oe=69D4FF77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://